    "text": "noncomputable def selectedRepresentation (root : PureState A) (j : GNSClass A) :\n    MathlibAnnex.Analysis.CStarAlgebra.Representation A (SelectedGNS root j) :=\n  (representative root j).positiveFunctional.gnsStarAlgHom",
