  "guide": "Here `root` is $\\omega$, `j` is a GNS equivalence class, `representative root j` is $\\varphi_j$, and `SelectedGNS root j` is $H_j$. The RHS `positiveFunctional.gnsStarAlgHom` is $\\pi_j$. The vector $\\xi_j$ is named `selectedVector root j` in its separate cited definition; the normalization, vector-functional identity and irreducibility are separate cited theorems, not extra fields of this definition.",
